// Copy this file to "PostHog.local.xcconfig" in this same directory (already gitignored) and
// fill in your own value. Never commit the real file or a real project token.
//
// PostHog Cloud EU project token (Project settings > "Project API Key" in the PostHog dashboard —
// NOT a personal/private API key; that key must never be placed in this app). This is a public,
// client-safe token by PostHog's own design, but it still must not be committed or hardcoded —
// see docs/analytics-setup.md.
//
// Leave blank/absent to run Togetherly with analytics disabled (falls back to no-op analytics).
// Unlike RevenueCat.local.xcconfig.example, this file intentionally ships with no placeholder
// token value — PostHog has no "test store"-style safe-to-commit key the way RevenueCat does,
// so a real project token must always come from your own PostHog Cloud EU project, never from a
// value checked into this repository.
POSTHOG_PROJECT_KEY=
// Leave blank to default to PostHog Cloud EU (https://eu.i.posthog.com).
POSTHOG_HOST=
